## The game data IS included — see NOTICE.md. It is generated from the books by the scripts in
## tools/, and it is here because this repository exists to be read by the Weird Frontiers rights
## holders and by playtesters, both of whom need the complete module to judge or play it.
##
## What stays out: YOUR copy of the source books themselves (corpus/, *.pdf, below). The data is
## derived; the books are not ours to pass on.

